      <div type="text" xml:id="fixture-nicene-381-text">
        <div type="unit" xml:id="fixture-nicene-381-unit-1">
          <p>We believe in one God, the Father Almighty, Maker of heaven and earth, and of all things visible and invisible.</p>
        </div>
        <div type="unit" xml:id="fixture-nicene-381-unit-2">
          <p>And in one Lord Jesus Christ, the only-begotten Son of God, begotten of the Father before all worlds; God of God, Light of Light, very God of very God; begotten, not made, being of one substance with the Father, by whom all things were made.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
